      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1760,
      "width": 1469.53125,
      "height": 137.5,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "text": "Tools and model generation are separate routes. Replies return to the requesting specialist or coordinator.\nLogical A2A arrows pass through the controller; they are not direct worker-to-worker RPCs.\nRetrieval state is copied per Pod; Feast/Milvus Lite/encoder execute inside Retrieval MCP, not as a Milvus server.\nDrift MCP accepts 32–200 API snapshots (recorded run: 32) before PSI; MMD remains an independent offline study.\nTrace export uses /iot-telemetry/v1/traces → observer → Jaeger, separate from generation/model selection.",
      "angle": 0,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 1450032368,
