      "originalText": "Tools and model generation are separate routes. Replies return to the requesting specialist or coordinator.\nLogical A2A arrows pass through the controller; they are not direct worker-to-worker RPCs.\nRetrieval state is copied per Pod; Feast/Milvus Lite/encoder execute inside Retrieval MCP, not as a Milvus server.\nDrift MCP accepts 32–200 API snapshots (recorded run: 32) before PSI; MMD remains an independent offline study.\nTrace export uses /iot-telemetry/v1/traces → observer → Jaeger, separate from generation/model selection.",
